#. §8: `A ∨ B`
#. §9: `left`
#. §10: `right`
#: Game/Doc/Tactic.lean:87
msgid "The §0 tactic breaks down a proof goal into its constituent parts:\n"
"\n"
"| before | after                |\n"
"|:------------ |:----------------------- |\n"
"| §1    | §2 and §3         |\n"
"| §4    | §5 and §6 |\n"
"\n"
"## Friends and relatives\n"
"\n"
"* You can break down an *assumption* into its components using §7.\n"
"* If you want to prove §8, you have to choose one side using §9 or §10."
msgstr ""
"La táctica §0 divide un objetivo en sus componentes:\n"
"\n"
"| antes        | después                 |\n"
"|:------------ |:----------------------- |\n"
"| §1           | §2 y §3                 |\n"
"| §4           | §5 y §6                 |\n"
"\n"
"## Amigos y familiares\n"
"\n"
"* Una *hipótesis* la descompones en sus componentes con §7.\n"
"* Si quieres demostrar §8, tienes que decidirte por uno de los lados con §9 o §10."

#. §0: `contradiction`
