#. ```
#: Game/Doc/Tactic.lean:134
msgid "Two subsets of a given set are equal if they have the same elements.\n"
"If the proof goal is\n"
"§0\n"
"for two subsets of §1 (i.e., for §2),\n"
"then §3 converts the proof goal into the equivalence\n"
"§4"
msgstr ""
"Dos subconjuntos de un conjunto dado son iguales si tienen los mismos elementos.\n"
"Si el objetivo es\n"
"§0\n"
"para dos subconjuntos de §1 (i.e. para §2) §3 transforma el objetivo en la equivalencia\n"
"§4"

