#. §4: `if A then B else C`
#. §5: `B`
#. §6: `h : ¬ A`
#. §7: `rw [if_neg h]`
#. §8: `if A then B else C`
#. §9: `C`
#: Game/Doc/Tactic.lean:214
msgid "With §0, you can define mappings with two branches of definition.\n"
"\n"
"For example, §1 defines the absolute value function.\n"
"\n"
"## Friends and relatives\n"
"\n"
"* If you have §2 as an assumption, you can use\n"
"§3 to reduce the expression §4 to §5.\n"
"* If you have §6 as an assumption, you can use\n"
"§7 to reduce the expression §8 to §9."
msgstr ""
"Con §0 puedes definir aplicaciones con dos tramos.\n"
"\n"
"Por ejemplo, §1 define la función valor absoluto.\n"
"\n"
"## Amigos y familiares\n"
"\n"
"* Si tienes §2 como hipótesis, puedes reducir con §3 la expresión §4 a §5.\n"
"* Si tienes §6 como hipótesis, puedes reducir análogamente con §7 la expresión §8 a §9."

