"If your proof goal is §3, §4 gives you the assumption §5, and you then have to prove §6.\n"
"If your proof goal is §7, §8 gices you an arbitrary §9 and you have to prove §10.\n"
"\n"
"| before | tactic       | after                     |\n"
"|:------------ |:------------ |:---------------------------- |\n"
"| §11    | §12    | §13, §14               |\n"
"| §15  | §16 | §17, §18, §19 |\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"## Friends and relatives\n"
